        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86077, Reed Knoxville Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knoxville 8 Inch Back-to-Back Pull Set has a traditional reed design that is wonderful at picking up the highlights of finishes. This door handle is available in a few different finishes, including french antique, oil rubbed bronze, and the ever popular satin nickel. The Reed Knoxville Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair comes packaged as a set of pulls--one for each side of a single door--and the mounting hardware needed to install them. The Knoxville Pull will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/8-inch-knoxville-door-handle-emtek-86077\"><b>Knoxville Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Reeded Knoxville Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-7-finish.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"600\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
